WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.114
Hey, I'm Jordan with Artifex Labs.

00:00:02.114 --> 00:00:12.062
We built Quick-Fix for businesses that don't need a giant redesign, a long consulting engagement, or weeks of back-and-forth just to solve one specific problem.

00:00:12.062 --> 00:00:23.565
For this Quick-Fix, we're focused on a defined technical search-visibility issue — things like page metadata, indexing-related configuration, or other scoped on-page technical problems.

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:29.223
We'll correct the identified issue and verify that the implementation is properly in place.

00:00:29.223 --> 00:00:31.150
The process is straightforward.

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:44.207
Once you move forward, we confirm exactly what needs to be fixed, collect only the access or information required to do the work, make the change, test it, and give you clear confirmation of what was completed.

00:00:44.207 --> 00:00:46.570
We keep the scope intentionally tight.

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:56.207
You'll know what you're paying for before the work starts, and if we discover something outside that scope, we don't quietly turn it into a bigger project.

00:00:56.207 --> 00:00:59.378
We explain it and let you decide what happens next.

00:00:59.378 --> 00:01:09.824
The goal of Quick-Fix is simple: identify a real problem, fix it properly, and get you back to business without making the process more complicated than it needs to be.

00:01:09.824 --> 00:01:11.378
That's Artifex Quick-Fix.

